# The L3 suite's build and run artifacts.
#
# `results/playwright.json` is the recorder's INPUT, not the record: what gets
# committed is the card `record_verdict.py` writes into evals/history/, which
# is where this repository keeps measurements it later cites. Committing the
# raw report too would put two copies of one run in the tree with no rule about
# which one a reader should believe.
node_modules/
results/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/
